148:**Priority 1 — HMT&C Path A candidates.** Papers flagged in the manifest as HMT&C Path A source candidates. Directly relevant to certification threshold setting: report concentration values for specific metals in specific food matrices, adequate sample size, credible methods. Target: complete Priority 1 before beginning Priority 2.
